<p class="p1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1">&nbsp;Hello&nbsp;</span></font><font>{!Contact.FirstName},</font></font></p><p class="p1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1" style="-webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="p1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><span class="s1" style="-webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;">&nbsp; The first quarter of 2017 is drawing to a close and we&nbsp;haven't&nbsp;connected yet to discuss your investment goals for the fiscal year. My focus is&nbsp;</span><span class="s2" style="-webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;">specifically</span><span class="s1" style="-webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;">&nbsp;supporting our existing clients to continue their portfolio development. Due to having a limited 700 properties this year for our 1,400+ clients, it very important that we set a game plan for your next&nbsp;acquisition. If we include new investors&nbsp;that are looking to start&nbsp;building their portfolios, the scarcity of&nbsp;opportunities gets even thinner.</span></font></p>
<p class="p2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></p>
<p class="p1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">We want to emphasize that supporting our existing clients to build their portfolios is what is most important to us. We want to ensure we are able to&nbsp;provide the&nbsp;opportunities you need for portfolio growth. Please let me know when is a good time for us to jump on a quick call to discuss your next&nbsp;acquisition whether it be next&nbsp;month or next year.&nbsp;</font></span></p>
<p class="p2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></p>
<p class="p1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">Best regards,</font></span></p>
<p class="p1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><br></font></p>
<p class="p3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><span class="s1"></span></font></p>
<p class="p5" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">Rick Luebbert</font></span></p>
<p class="p5" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">Portfolio Advisor</font></span></p>
<p class="p5" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span class="s1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3">Memphis Invest, GP</font></span></p>
<p class="p4"><b><font color="#cc0000" face="Arial, sans-serif" size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></b></p>
